                List.of(returnItem(foreign, 1))).getResponse().getStatus()).isEqualTo(400);

        // 第一批合法归还成功：此前失败批次均未落账
        MvcResult ok = returnBatch("alice", packageKey, "recv-r1", "recv-r2",
                List.of(returnItem(evs.get(0), 1)));
